{"title":"Career Roadmap: Content Strategist","role":"Content Strategist","summary":"A Content Strategist plans what content an organization should create, for whom, why, where, when and how success will be measured.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (General / Honours)","Course":"Digital Marketing / Social Media Analytics"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in content strategy, audience research, SEO, social media, analytics, storytelling and digital campaign planning"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Content Strategist plans what content an organization should create, for whom, why, where, when and how success will be measured."},{"type":"p","text":"The role goes beyond writing posts. A strategist connects:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Goal","Audience","Research","Content Strategy","Creation","Distribution","Analytics","Optimization"]},{"type":"p","text":"Content Strategists can work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Blogs"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Email"},{"text":"Video"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Brand campaigns"},{"text":"Product marketing"},{"text":"B2B content"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Personal brands"},{"text":"Education and media"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest modern profile combines content","marketing","analytics","SEO","AI-assisted workflows."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Writing + marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Communication, branding, consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Writing portfolio"},{"text":"Only creating generic posts"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Content + social media"},{"text":"SEO, platforms, content formats"},{"text":"Social/content campaigns"},{"text":"No analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Strategy + analytics"},{"text":"GA4, SEO, dashboards, experimentation"},{"text":"Campaign case studies"},{"text":"Focusing only on creativity"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Integrated content strategy"},{"text":"AI, growth, performance marketing"},{"text":"Internship + capstone"},{"text":"No real business projects"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*Applicable where the B.Sc. program is four years."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"},{"text":"Introduction to marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Copywriting fundamentals"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Digital media fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Social media fundamentals"},{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Content formats"},{"text":"Visual communication"},{"text":"Canva/Adobe basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Blog strategy"},{"text":"Website content"},{"text":"Social media strategy"},{"text":"Content calendars"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social media analytics"},{"text":"Web analytics"},{"text":"Google Analytics concepts"},{"text":"Conversion funnels"},{"text":"Engagement metrics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Performance reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Brand voice"},{"text":"Content pillars"},{"text":"Editorial planning"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Video content strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Growth marketing"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Content distribution"},{"text":"Paid media fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing dashboards"},{"text":"Internship preparation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 7–8, if applicable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced content strategy"},{"text":"AI-assisted content operations"},{"text":"Content experimentation"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Capstone"},{"text":"Industry internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Marketing Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing funnel"},{"text":"STP"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Targeting"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Buyer personas"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Conversion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Funnel"},{"type":"flow","items":["Awareness","Consideration","Conversion","Retention","Advocacy"]},{"type":"p","text":"Content should serve different objectives at different stages."}]},{"heading":"Audience Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Content Strategist should know the audience before deciding what to publish."},{"type":"p","text":"Research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demographics"},{"text":"Psychographics"},{"text":"Needs"},{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Goals"},{"text":"Buying behaviour"},{"text":"Search behaviour"},{"text":"Content preferences"},{"text":"Objections"},{"text":"Competitor alternatives"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Search data"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Website analytics"},{"text":"Customer reviews"},{"text":"Community discussions"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Content Strategy Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a repeatable process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Objective","Audience","Content Goal","Topic","Format","Channel","Distribution","KPI","Measurement","Optimization"]