 understand SEO even if a dedicated SEO specialist executes the technical work."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Topic clusters"},{"text":"Long-tail keywords"},{"text":"On-page SEO"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Headings"},{"text":"Content structure"},{"text":"Backlinks"},{"text":"Technical SEO fundamentals"},{"text":"Content freshness"},{"text":"Search performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of producing:"},{"type":"p","text":"50 unrelated articles"},{"type":"p","text":"build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pillar Topic","Subtopics","Supporting Articles","Internal Links"]}]},{"heading":"Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Web Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics concepts"},{"text":"Search Console"},{"text":"Traffic sources"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"User journeys"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"CPL"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Organic traffic"},{"text":"Content-assisted conversions"}]}]},{"heading":"Content Experimentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Hooks"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Thumbnails"},{"text":"Content formats"},{"text":"Posting times"},{"text":"Landing-page copy"},{"text":"Email subject lines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hypothesis","Experiment","Metric","Result","Learning","Next Test"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid changing multiple variables simultaneously when the goal is to understand causality."}]},{"heading":"Content Distribution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Creating good content is only half 